'''Barry''' (Japanese: '''ジュン''' ''Jun'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=During this turn, attacks used by your {{TCGP|Snorlax}}, {{TCGP|Heracross}}, and {{TCGP|Staraptor}} cost 2 less {{e|Colorless}} Energy.
}}

