==Trivia==
* {{TCG|Barry}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*{{ga|Barry}} is a [[rival]] character in {{game|Diamond and Pearl|s|Pokémon Diamond, Pearl}}, {{v2|Platinum}}, {{pkmn|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl|Brilliant Diamond, and Shining Pearl}}. Barry uses {{p|Snorlax}}, {{p|Heracross}}, and {{p|Staraptor}} in his late-game and post-game teams in these games.
** The standard print of this card—along with the {{TCG ID|Triumphant Light|Heracross|1}}, {{TCG ID|Triumphant Light|Snorlax|63}}, and {{TCG ID|Triumphant Light|Staraptor|68}} cards from {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}}—also make up the expansion's "Barry, the Rival" [[Triumphant Light (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]].
*The interior of the [[Sinnoh]] {{si|Pokémon League}}'s lobby—where players battle Barry for the final time before taking on the [[Elite Four#Sinnoh Elite Four|Elite Four]]—is featured in the regular print's illustration, as depicted in {{pkmn|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl}}.

